<body style="font-family:source sans pro">

<span style="font-size:8px;"><img src="https://kooziegroup--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153p000003Puwa&oid=00D1U000000oeAl&lastMod=1605184005000" style="max-width: 840.197px; width: 140.998px; height: 25.9981px;" title="Koozie Group Logo" /></span><br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-size:15px;"><b><span style="color:#009faa;"><span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;&quot;;">keep</span></span><span style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="color:#da9122;">the</span>&nbsp;<b><span style="color:#94bd4c;"><span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: Source Sans Pro;, sans-serif;&quot;;">good</span></span><span style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="color:#92278a;">going<span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif;">&reg;</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<p align="left" style="text-align:left"><b>Thanks for ordering from Koozie Group!</b><br/><br/>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to review your proof.</p>

<p align="left" style="text-align:left">Please be advised that your order is <u><b>ON HOLD</b></u> until your proof is approved. Your order will remain on hold until you follow the link below, then click one of the proof approval options.</p>
    
    <p><b>PO Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Order Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Product Number:</b>{!relatedTo.ProductID} </p>

<p><b>You must follow the link below to view your proof and then click approved, approved with changes or not approved.</b> Please do not reply to this email. Replying to this email will not move your order into production.</p>

<p style="color:red;">Please place the link here</p>

<p><b>If clicking this link results in an error, please copy and paste the address into your internet browser.</b></p>
     
    
    <p>This proof approval process allows you to clearly view proofs on any mobile device, print, download, email or save the proof as a PDF. Plus, with just two clicks your proof can be approved faster than ever before, and we will begin production as soon as we get your go-ahead. </p>
    


Please carefully review for the following:<br/>

<ul><li>Typographical Errors</li>
     <li>Valid Color Separation</li>
    <li>Correct Imprint Position and Size</li>
    <li>Correct Imprinting Colors</li>
    <li>Missing Type/Copy/Logos</li>
    <li>Correct Layout</li>
</ul>  


<p>Issues: <br/>
<br/><c:clarQuestions rcaseID="{!relatedTo}"/>
<br/>
</p>

